}},"zone":{"label":"the yellow-line zone the Israeli army declared (as of 18 June 2026)","color":"#f2c200","fill":0.08,"width":2.4,"src":"village-maps/96/context.geojson","where":{"k":"zone"}},"municipality":{"label":"the municipality of Al-Mansouri","color":"#2b2a28","fill":0,"width":2.0,"src":"village-maps/96/context.geojson","where":{"k":"municipality"}},"area":{"label":"the ground the buildings were counted on: the town and 1.5 km round it","color":"#6b6b6b","fill":0,"width":1.6,"src":"village-maps/96/context.geojson","where":{"k":"counting_area"}},"w0":{"label":"first seen destroyed or damaged by the picture of 23 May 2026","color":"#5c0f1c","fill":0.85,"width":1.0,"src":"village-maps/96/buildings.geojson","where":{"w":"w0","k":["building_destroyed","building_damaged"]}},"w1":{"label":"first seen destroyed or damaged between the pictures of 23 May 2026 and 10 August 2026","color":"#a3162f","fill":0.85,"width":1.0,"src":"village-maps/96/buildings.geojson","where":{"w":"w1","k":["building_destroyed","building_damaged"]}},"w2":{"label":"first seen destroyed or damaged between the pictures of 10 August 2026 and 19 August 2026","color":"#e0242c","fill":0.85,"width":1.0,"src":"village-maps/96/buildings.geojson","where":{"w":"w2","k":["building_destroyed","building_damaged"]}},"w3":{"label":"first seen destroyed or damaged between the pictures of 19 August 2026 and 8 October 2026","color":"#ff7a00","fill":0.85,"width":1.0,"src":"village-maps/96/buildings.geojson","where":{"w":"w3","k":["building_destroyed","building_damaged"]}},"wx":{"label":"destroyed or damaged, not dated more closely","color":"#9c8f86","fill":0.6,"width":0.8,"src":"village-maps/96/buildings.geojson","where":{"w":"wx","k":["building_destroyed","building_damaged"]}}},"steps":[{"title":"A town on the coast, inside the yellow line","text":["Al-Mansouri lies on the coast south of Tyre, between the sea and the hills: its houses on the slope, and between them and the sea a plain of citrus and banana orchards and fields.","In the 2026 war the town lies inside the zone the Israeli army declared south of its yellow line (the outline of 18 June 2026). The corpus holds 1 displacement order naming Al-Mansouri (the week of 2 March 2026), and 13 more that told everyone in a whole region round it to leave: south of the Zahrani river (12) and south of the Litani river (1)."],"figures":[{"kind":"ALR","value":"1","label":"order naming the town"},{"kind":"ALR","value":"13","label":"region-wide orders that include it"}],"note":"Orders are counted by week; the outlines of the region-wide orders are on the database's map.","camera":{"center":[35.2045,33.1755],"zoom":12.9,"pitch":30,"bearing":-15},"base":"satellite","terrain":false,"kinds":["ALR"],"towns":["Al-Mansouri"],"layers":{"areas":["zone","municipality"],"lines":false}},{"title":"Its houses","text":["Across the town and the ground within 1.5 km of it (3,223 ha, outlined in grey), 1,110 buildings were found destroyed and 151 damaged on sharp pictures from before the war and from 2026. Each was read on its own before and after pictures in several independent readings, and counted only when most of them agreed.","32 of them stood on no map of the town's buildings from before the war: they were found on later building maps or on the pictures themselves, and independent readings confirmed that each stood before and was hit after."],"figures":[{"value":"1,110","label":"buildings destroyed"},{"value":"151","label":"buildings damaged"},{"value":"32","label":"of them on no pre-war map"}],"note":"A building is drawn where it was found on two pictures; the count says where, never why or by whom.","camera":{"center":[35.2105,33.1735],"zoom":15.2,"pitch":40,"bearing":-20},"base":"satellite","terrain":false,"kinds":[],"layers":{"areas":["area","destroyed","damaged","added"],"lines":false}},{"title":"Detonations, week after week","text":["From the week of 20 July 2026 to the week of 5 October 2026, Lebanese media reported the Israeli army detonating houses in Al-Mansouri in 12 different weeks, on 48 days in all, on up to 7 days in a week. On 11 September 2026 Annahar counted about 25 detonations in five hours, in a report and photographs by Ahmad Mantash.","The town's 4 sharp pictures of 2026 were taken on 23 May 2026, 10 August 2026, 19 August 2026 and 8 October 2026. On the one of 19 August, plumes of smoke or dust stand over the centre of the village, beside ground that had turned dark."],"figures":[{"kind":"DET","value":"48","label":"days with detonations reported"},{"kind":"DET","value":"12","label":"weeks with reports"}],"note":"The days are counted by week. Their collection is not complete, so these are the days found, not every detonation.","camera":{"center":[35.2105,33.1735],"zoom":14.6,"pitch":35,"bearing":-20},"base":"satellite","terrain":false,"kinds":[],"layers":{"areas":["destroyed","damaged","added"],"lines":false}},{"title":"When the houses were hit","text":["The buildings were read on the town's sharp pictures in turn, to find the last picture on which each stood intact and the first on which it was destroyed or damaged. Where the pictures gave no date, a building is dated by the day Sentinel-2 first saw its ground change.","180 were already destroyed or damaged by the first picture of 2026. Then: 168 between 23 May 2026 and 10 August 2026, 45 between 10 August 2026 and 19 August 2026 and 533 between 19 August 2026 and 8 October 2026. 335 cannot be dated more closely than their pair of pictures."],"figures":[{"value":"180","label":"destroyed or damaged by 23 May"},{"value":"168","label":"23 May to 10 August"},{"value":"45","label":"10 August to 19 August"},{"value":"533","label":"19 August to 8 October"}],"note":"A building is drawn on the day it was first seen destroyed or damaged, which is when it entered the record, not when it was hit.","camera":{"center":[35.2105,33.1735],"zoom":15.0,"pitch":30,"bearing":-20},"base":"satellite","terrain":false,"kinds":[],"layers":{"areas":["w0","w1","w2","w3","wx"],"lines":false}},{"title":"Orchards, fields and roads bulldozed","text":["Green Southerners outlined, by hand, the orchards, fields and trees that were green on a picture of August 2023 and burned or bulldozed by 8 October 2026: 33 outlines, 98.4 ha. They say what was lost between the two pictures, not when.","25.8 ha of ground were read as bulldozed between the pictures of 2026, and 22.0 km of roads in and round the town between pictures of 2024 and of 2026."],"figures":[{"value":"98.4 ha","label":"orchards, fields and trees outlined"},{"value":"25.8 ha","label":"bulldozed, read on 2026 pictures"},{"value":"22.0 km","label":"of roads bulldozed"}],"note":"Bulldozed ground and roads are drawn where they were found on two pictures: they say where and between which pictures, never why or by whom.","camera":{"center":[35.19928,33.17545],"zoom":14.3,"pitch":30,"bearing":-20},"base":"satellite","terrain":false,"kinds":[],"layers":{"areas":["orchards","bulldozed","roads"],"lines":false}},{"title":"Fires","text":["Since 1 March 2026 the corpus records 21 fires at Al-Mansouri, from 14 April 2026 to 30 September 2026: all of them linked to an Israeli attack. By what lit them: 16 by an explosion, 2 by illumination flares, 2 by an incendiary munition and 1 by white phosphorus. Where a burn scar was measured on Sentinel-2, 4 of them cover 2.7 ha between them."],"figures":[{"kind":"BRN","value":"21","label":"fires"}],"note":"A fire is counted at its town; the burned ground on the map is merged by month.","camera":{"center":[35.2110878,33.1736531],"zoom":13.4,"pitch":35,"bearing":0},"base":"light","terrain":false,"kinds":["BRN"],"towns":["Al-Mansouri"],"layers":{"scars":true}},{"title":"White phosphorus","text":["The corpus records 6 white phosphorus attacks at Al-Mansouri, from the week of 23 March 2026 to the week of 3 August 2026, each counted apart from every other kind of record."],"figures":[{"kind":"WPB","value":"6","label":"white phosphorus attacks"}],"camera":{"center":[35.2110878,33.1736531],"zoom":12.8,"pitch":20,"bearing":0},"base":"light","terrain":false,"kinds":["WPB"],"towns":["Al-Mansouri"],"layers":{}},{"title":"Read it yourself","text":["Open the map of Al-Mansouri to read every layer together, over each of its sharp pictures, with the records counted week by week under it. Below this story: every part of the October 2026 picture beside the same ground before the war, the village through 2026, and what was published about the detonations.","The records themselves are not published; to access them, contact Green Southerners."],"explore":"investigations/al-mansouri-map.html","camera":{"center":[35.2045,33.1755],"zoom":13.8,"pitch":40,"bearing":-20},"base":"satellite","terrain":false,"kinds":["BRN","WPB","ALR"],"towns":["Al-Mansouri"],"layers":{"areas":["orchards","destroyed","damaged","added","roads"],"scars":true,"lines":false}}],"pcods":["62287","62294","62296","62297","62298","62299"]}